    "detailed_description": "A cute, fun platformer for all ages. Travel though the arctic,caves and ocean. Eat fish along the way, and make your way to the factory. Play as PIP, or Owl, and take back the arctic from the evil oil drilling company's CEO!!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nDuring your travels, you will meet various characters to help you along the quest; while helping them with tasks along the way!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYou may encounter puzzles, obstacles and find new expansive worlds. Dive into water caves and find hidden treasures! You will feel the classic platformer Nostalgia, of an old era!",
